# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This example shows the basic workflow of the LTM AI-QEM function with a simple $n$-qubit GHZ circuit and the two-body tensor product observable $Z_iZ_j$, whose expectation value for the GHZ state is known to be 1.\n"
msgstr "Contoh ini menunjukkan aliran kerja asas fungsi LTM AI-QEM dengan litar GHZ $n$-qubit yang ringkas dan observabel hasil darab tensor dua jasad $Z_iZ_j$, yang nilai jangkaannya untuk keadaan GHZ diketahui ialah 1.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Construct the PUB {#construct-the-pub}"
msgstr "Bina PUB {#construct-the-pub}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Like the Estimator primitive, the LTM AI-QEM function accepts primitive unified blocs (PUBs) as input. A PUB is a tuple of the form `(circuit, observables, parameter_values, precision)`, where `parameter_values` is required for parametric circuits and `precision` is optional.\n"
msgstr "Seperti primitif Estimator, fungsi LTM AI-QEM menerima blok bersatu primitif (PUB) sebagai input. PUB ialah tuple berbentuk `(circuit, observables, parameter_values, precision)`, di mana `parameter_values` diperlukan untuk litar berparameter dan `precision` adalah pilihan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title #####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Circuit {#circuit}"
msgstr "Litar {#circuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The $n$-qubit Greenberger-Horne-Zeilinger (GHZ) state is given by:\n"
"$$\n"
"|GHZ\\rangle_{n}\n"
"= \\frac{\\vert{0}\\rangle^{\\otimes{n}} + \\vert{1}\\rangle^{\\otimes{n}}}{\\sqrt2}\n"
"= \\frac{\\overbrace{\\vert{00}\\dots{0}\\rangle}^{\\text{$n$ qubits}} + \\overbrace{\\vert{11}\\dots{1}\\rangle}^{\\text{$n$ qubits}}}{\\sqrt2}.\n"
"$$\n"
"To construct the $n$-qubit GHZ state, initialize all qubits in the $|0\\rangle$ state and apply a Hadamard gate to the first qubit to create an equal superposition. Then apply a sequence of CNOT gates across the entire register, with qubit $i$ as the control and qubit $i+1$ as the target. This staircase of entangling gates propagates the initial superposition to all qubits, which results in the entangled GHZ state.\n"
msgstr ""
"Keadaan Greenberger-Horne-Zeilinger (GHZ) $n$-qubit diberikan oleh:\n"
"$$\n"
"|GHZ\\rangle_{n}\n"
"= \\frac{\\vert{0}\\rangle^{\\otimes{n}} + \\vert{1}\\rangle^{\\otimes{n}}}{\\sqrt2}\n"
"= \\frac{\\overbrace{\\vert{00}\\dots{0}\\rangle}^{\\text{$n$ qubit}} + \\overbrace{\\vert{11}\\dots{1}\\rangle}^{\\text{$n$ qubit}}}{\\sqrt2}.\n"
"$$\n"
"Untuk membina keadaan GHZ $n$-qubit, mulakan semua qubit dalam keadaan $|0\\rangle$ dan gunakan gate Hadamard pada qubit pertama untuk mencipta superposisi sama rata. Kemudian gunakan jujukan gate CNOT merentasi seluruh daftar, dengan qubit $i$ sebagai kawalan dan qubit $i+1$ sebagai sasaran. Tangga gate berbelit ini merambatkan superposisi awal kepada semua qubit, yang menghasilkan keadaan GHZ berbelit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title #####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Observables {#observables}"
msgstr "Observabel {#observables}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Measuring the two-body tensor product $Z_i \\otimes Z_j$ on a GHZ state evaluates the parity correlation between any two qubits in the register. Because the GHZ state is a superposition of the all-zeros and all-ones states, any two qubits are perfectly correlated. The eigenvalue is $(+1 \\times +1) = 1$ for the $\\vert00\\dots0\\rangle$ branch and $(-1 \\times -1) = 1$ for the $\\vert11\\dots1\\rangle$ branch. Because both branches return +1, the theoretical expectation value is 1. Construct the observable with the `SparsePauliOp` class.\n"
msgstr "Mengukur hasil darab tensor dua jasad $Z_i \\otimes Z_j$ pada keadaan GHZ menilai korelasi pariti antara mana-mana dua qubit dalam daftar. Oleh sebab keadaan GHZ ialah superposisi keadaan semua-sifar dan semua-satu, mana-mana dua qubit berkorelasi secara sempurna. Nilai eigen ialah $(+1 \\times +1) = 1$ untuk cabang $\\vert00\\dots0\\rangle$ dan $(-1 \\times -1) = 1$ untuk cabang $\\vert11\\dots1\\rangle$. Oleh sebab kedua-dua cabang menghasilkan +1, nilai jangkaan teori ialah 1. Bina observabel dengan kelas `SparsePauliOp`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Because the circuit is not parametric, construct the PUB as `(circuit, observable)`.\n"
msgstr "Oleh sebab litar ini tidak berparameter, bina PUB sebagai `(circuit, observable)`.\n"

