# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Example 4: Brickwork Clifford circuit {#example-4-brickwork-clifford-circuit}"
msgstr "Contoh 4: Litar Clifford brickwork {#example-4-brickwork-clifford-circuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This example simulates Clifford circuits. This family of circuits is useful because you can design the simulation to have a known expectation value. Specifically, you can design the circuit and the observable so that the expectation value is always 1, as follows:\n"
msgstr "Contoh ini mensimulasikan litar Clifford. Keluarga litar ini berguna kerana anda boleh mereka bentuk simulasi supaya mempunyai nilai jangkaan yang diketahui. Secara khusus, anda boleh mereka bentuk litar dan observabel supaya nilai jangkaan sentiasa 1, seperti berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The starting point (the stabilizer):** Start with the vacuum state $|0\\rangle^{{\\otimes}n}$. Applying the Pauli $Z$ or the identity operator to $|0\\rangle$ leaves it unchanged: $Z|0\\rangle = |0\\rangle$ and $I |0\\rangle = |0\\rangle$. Therefore, any Pauli string $P$ that is a tensor product of only $Z$ and $I$ leaves the all-zero state $|0\\rangle^{{\\otimes}n}$ unchanged: $P |0\\rangle^{{\\otimes}n} = |0\\rangle^{{\\otimes}n}$.\n"
msgstr "**Titik permulaan (penstabil):** Mulakan dengan keadaan vakum $|0\\rangle^{{\\otimes}n}$. Mengenakan Pauli $Z$ atau operator identiti pada $|0\\rangle$ tidak mengubahnya: $Z|0\\rangle = |0\\rangle$ dan $I |0\\rangle = |0\\rangle$. Oleh itu, mana-mana rentetan Pauli $P$ yang merupakan hasil darab tensor $Z$ dan $I$ sahaja tidak mengubah keadaan semua-sifar $|0\\rangle^{{\\otimes}n}$: $P |0\\rangle^{{\\otimes}n} = |0\\rangle^{{\\otimes}n}$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The Clifford evolution:** Applying the unitary $U_L$ to the state gives $|\\psi\\rangle = U_L |0\\rangle^{{\\otimes}n}$. To find an observable whose expectation value for this new state is 1, apply the same unitary transformation to the operator: $O_L = U_L P U_L^{\\dagger}$. This is the Heisenberg picture of quantum mechanics.\n"
msgstr "**Evolusi Clifford:** Mengenakan unitari $U_L$ pada keadaan memberikan $|\\psi\\rangle = U_L |0\\rangle^{{\\otimes}n}$. Untuk mencari observabel yang nilai jangkaannya bagi keadaan baharu ini ialah 1, kenakan transformasi unitari yang sama pada operator: $O_L = U_L P U_L^{\\dagger}$. Ini ialah gambaran Heisenberg bagi mekanik kuantum.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Why the observable stays a single Pauli string:** If $U_L$ contained non-Clifford gates (such as T gates or arbitrary rotations), $U_L P U_L^\\dagger$ would expand into a sum of many different Pauli strings. You would have to measure many different observables and add them to get 1. However, because the circuit uses only Clifford gates, the Gottesman-Knill theorem guarantees that $U_L P U_L^\\dagger$ maps to exactly one Pauli string (for example, $X Y -Z X$).\n"
msgstr "**Mengapa observabel kekal sebagai satu rentetan Pauli:** Jika $U_L$ mengandungi Gate bukan Clifford (seperti Gate T atau putaran sewenang-wenangnya), $U_L P U_L^\\dagger$ akan berkembang menjadi hasil tambah banyak rentetan Pauli yang berbeza. Anda perlu mengukur banyak observabel berbeza dan menjumlahkannya untuk mendapat 1. Walau bagaimanapun, oleh sebab litar hanya menggunakan Gate Clifford, teorem Gottesman-Knill menjamin bahawa $U_L P U_L^\\dagger$ dipetakan kepada tepat satu rentetan Pauli (contohnya, $X Y -Z X$).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**The mathematical guarantee:** Because of this construction, computing the expectation value is a simple algebraic substitution:\n"
msgstr "**Jaminan matematik:** Disebabkan pembinaan ini, pengiraan nilai jangkaan ialah penggantian algebra yang mudah:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle O_L \\rangle = \\langle \\psi | O_L | \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\langle O_L \\rangle = \\langle \\psi | O_L | \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Substitute $|\\psi \\rangle$ and $O_L$:\n"
"$$\n"
"(\\langle 0 |^{\\otimes n} U_L^{\\dagger})\n"
"(U_L P U_L^{\\dagger})\n"
"(U_L | 0 \\rangle ^{\\otimes n})\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Gantikan $|\\psi \\rangle$ dan $O_L$:\n"
"$$\n"
"(\\langle 0 |^{\\otimes n} U_L^{\\dagger})\n"
"(U_L P U_L^{\\dagger})\n"
"(U_L | 0 \\rangle ^{\\otimes n})\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The adjacent $U_L^\\dagger U_L$ terms cancel (they equal the identity $I$):\n"
"$$\n"
"= \\langle 0 |^{\\otimes n} P | 0 \\rangle ^{\\otimes n}\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"Sebutan bersebelahan $U_L^\\dagger U_L$ saling membatalkan (ia sama dengan identiti $I$):\n"
"$$\n"
"= \\langle 0 |^{\\otimes n} P | 0 \\rangle ^{\\otimes n}\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Because $P$ is a tensor product of only $Z$ and $I$, $P| 0 \\rangle ^{\\otimes n} = | 0 \\rangle ^{\\otimes n}$, and therefore:\n"
"$$\n"
"= \\langle 0 |^{\\otimes n} | 0 \\rangle ^{\\otimes n} = 1\n"
"$$\n"
"First, design quantum circuits that contain only Clifford gates: the single-qubit gates $H$, $S$, $X$, $Y$, and $Z$, and the two-qubit gate $CZ$. The `create_brickwork_clifford` function takes the number of qubits (`num_qubits`) and `depth` as arguments, and returns a Clifford quantum circuit with the given number of qubits and depth.\n"
msgstr ""
"Oleh sebab $P$ ialah hasil darab tensor $Z$ dan $I$ sahaja, $P| 0 \\rangle ^{\\otimes n} = | 0 \\rangle ^{\\otimes n}$, dan oleh itu:\n"
"$$\n"
"= \\langle 0 |^{\\otimes n} | 0 \\rangle ^{\\otimes n} = 1\n"
"$$\n"
"Pertama, reka bentuk litar kuantum yang hanya mengandungi Gate Clifford: Gate satu qubit $H$, $S$, $X$, $Y$, dan $Z$, serta Gate dua qubit $CZ$. Fungsi `create_brickwork_clifford` menerima bilangan qubit (`num_qubits`) dan `depth` sebagai argumen, dan memulangkan litar kuantum Clifford dengan bilangan qubit dan kedalaman yang diberikan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The circuits in this example have 50 qubits (`num_qubits=50`) and varying depths: 30, 35, 40, 45, 50, 55, 60, 65, and 70. For the observables, start from a Pauli string $P$ with Pauli weight 2, that is, two Pauli $Z$ operators at random positions. Then use the `evolve` method to evolve $P$ into $U_{L_i} P U_{L_i}^{\\dagger}$ for the circuit $U_{L_i}$ of each depth. Save the circuits and the corresponding observables in the lists `circuits_list` and `observables_list`, respectively.\n"
msgstr "Litar dalam contoh ini mempunyai 50 qubit (`num_qubits=50`) dan kedalaman yang berbeza-beza: 30, 35, 40, 45, 50, 55, 60, 65, dan 70. Bagi observabel, mulakan daripada rentetan Pauli $P$ dengan berat Pauli 2, iaitu dua operator Pauli $Z$ pada kedudukan rawak. Kemudian gunakan kaedah `evolve` untuk mengevolusikan $P$ menjadi $U_{L_i} P U_{L_i}^{\\dagger}$ bagi litar $U_{L_i}$ pada setiap kedalaman. Simpan litar dan observabel yang sepadan dalam senarai `circuits_list` dan `observables_list`, masing-masing.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To get the ideal values, run a stabilizer simulation. Create a stabilizer state from each quantum circuit with the Qiskit `StabilizerState` class, which takes a `QuantumCircuit` as input and outputs the corresponding stabilizer state. Then use the `expectation_value` method to calculate the ideal expectation value, which by design is 1 for each circuit and observable pair.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mendapatkan nilai unggul, jalankan simulasi penstabil. Cipta keadaan penstabil daripada setiap litar kuantum dengan kelas Qiskit `StabilizerState`, yang menerima `QuantumCircuit` sebagai input dan mengeluarkan keadaan penstabil yang sepadan. Kemudian gunakan kaedah `expectation_value` untuk mengira nilai jangkaan unggul, yang mengikut reka bentuk ialah 1 bagi setiap pasangan litar dan observabel.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Next, create a list of PUBs named `clifford_pubs` and pass it to `ltm_function` to compute the expectation values on hardware and mitigate them with AI-QEM.\n"
msgstr "Seterusnya, cipta senarai PUB bernama `clifford_pubs` dan hantarkannya kepada `ltm_function` untuk mengira nilai jangkaan pada perkakasan dan memitigasinya dengan AI-QEM.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Title ####
#, no-wrap
msgid "Extract and visualize the results {#extract-and-visualize-the-results-2}"
msgstr "Ekstrak dan visualisasikan hasil {#extract-and-visualize-the-results-2}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "After the job finishes, collect the expectation values and standard deviations from each PUB result. For every circuit depth, the results include the noisy (unmitigated) values, `noisy_evs` and `noisy_stds`, and the values after mitigation by AI-QEM, `mitigated_evs` and `mitigated_stds`.\n"
msgstr "Selepas kerja selesai, kumpulkan nilai jangkaan dan sisihan piawai daripada setiap hasil PUB. Bagi setiap kedalaman litar, hasilnya merangkumi nilai berhingar (tanpa mitigasi), `noisy_evs` dan `noisy_stds`, serta nilai selepas mitigasi oleh AI-QEM, `mitigated_evs` dan `mitigated_stds`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Then use the `plot_clifford_results` function to plot the expectation value against the circuit depth. The plot contains the following:\n"
msgstr "Kemudian gunakan fungsi `plot_clifford_results` untuk memplot nilai jangkaan terhadap kedalaman litar. Plot tersebut mengandungi perkara berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Unmitigated:** The raw expectation values returned by the hardware, shown with error bars of size $\\pm\\sigma$.\n"
msgstr "**Tanpa mitigasi:** Nilai jangkaan mentah yang dipulangkan oleh perkakasan, ditunjukkan dengan bar ralat bersaiz $\\pm\\sigma$.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Mitigated (AI-QEM):** The expectation values after error mitigation, also shown with error bars.\n"
msgstr "**Dengan mitigasi (AI-QEM):** Nilai jangkaan selepas mitigasi ralat, juga ditunjukkan dengan bar ralat.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Ideal (stabilizer simulation):** The noiseless expectation value, $\\langle O \\rangle_{\\text{ideal}} = 1$, for all depths.\n"
msgstr "**Unggul (simulasi penstabil):** Nilai jangkaan tanpa hingar, $\\langle O \\rangle_{\\text{ideal}} = 1$, untuk semua kedalaman.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-20
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "**Threshold:** A gray band that covers $-0.1 \\le \\langle O \\rangle \\le 0.1$. Values inside this band have no useful signal to mitigate, so they are left unmitigated.\n"
msgstr "**Ambang:** Jalur kelabu yang meliputi $-0.1 \\le \\langle O \\rangle \\le 0.1$. Nilai di dalam jalur ini tidak mempunyai isyarat berguna untuk dimitigasi, maka ia dibiarkan tanpa mitigasi.\n"

